{
  "headline": "Mesalamine is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; supply at Corvale East is 5.5 days on hand and the best option is a transfer from Corvale Lakeside",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "D1", "D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include mesalamine as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 49 capsules of mesalamine 0.375 g with a daily use of 9, giving 5.5 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 50 capsules of the same presentation with a daily use of 1.8, giving 27.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option by rule is to transfer 24 capsules of 0.375 g from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would leave Lakeside with two weeks of supply and raise East to 8 days.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternative transfer of 28 capsules from Corvale General would also meet the two-week buffer for General and raise East to 9 days.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for NDC 70771162507 names Zydus Lifesciences Limited as the labeler and a registered plant with a VAI inspection on 2023-03-24.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows discontinued postings for Mylan Pharmaceuticals Inc. on 2026-08-25 and Takeda Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. on 2026-09-16, but these are for different NDCs.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E11"]
    }
  ]
}
